<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, perfect redemption, the purchase of blood,</l><l>To every believer the promise of God;</l><l>The vilest offender who truly believes,</l><l>That moment from Jesus a pardon receives.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Great things He hath taught us, great things He hath done,</l><l>And great our rejoicing through Jesus the Son;</l><l>But purer, and higher, and greater will be</l><l>Our wonder, our transport when Jesus we see.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
